         the include path) -> C1083. With -opt, module.g.cpp uses winrt_make_* forward
         declarations instead, and the targets compile XamlMetaDataProvider.cpp. This
         matches the VS Blank App template (its checked-in module.g.cpp is -opt form). -->
    <CppWinRTOptimized>true</CppWinRTOptimized>
